{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 59, :comments ["And the reason for <b>whom she bore to Levi in Egypt</b> — on the level of peshat: since all the sons of Jacob, with all their sons and daughters, came down to Egypt, and there was none among them who fathered children there afterward, except Levi, who fathered the mother of the children, Simchah (Jochebed), for HaShem delayed her birth because the appointed end had not yet arrived, as I have already explained (Genesis 46:15)."], :book :numbers, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:09:04.585304303Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}